[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-w-main 5.c3"]
[Name "5...e6: the bishop stays in"]

5... e6 { Black shuts in the bishop on c8. }
6. Bf4 { So White's bishop gets out first, as ever. }
6... Bd6
7. Bxd6 Qxd6
8. Nd2 { The usual knight. After 8...Nf6 the game is in the line with 6...e6. }
8... Nf6 *
